*** PRELUDE
*** A2g-float-accept — float(String) accepts only valid Maude float syntax (fable-audit.md §3.2)
red in CONVERSION : float("NaN") .
red in CONVERSION : float("nan") .
red in CONVERSION : float("inf") .
red in CONVERSION : float("5") .
*** guard: a well-formed spelling still reduces
red in CONVERSION : float("Infinity") .
